<title>USA: Farmington MSD 5, N.M., won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Farmington MSD 5, N.M., won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said it won $6.100 million of Farmington Municipal School District No. 5, N.M., general obligation school building bonds, Series July 1, 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.90 percent.</p>
</text>
